8**:  \n   From January 1 to August 31, 2008:  \n   \\(31 + 29 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 31 = 244\\) days.  \n\n2. **Total Possible Days**:  \n   The entire valid date range spans **365 days** (September 2, 2007\u2013August 31, 2008).  \n\n### Probability:  \nThe probability Maxim was born in 2008 is the ratio of days in 2008 to the total valid days:  \n\\[\n\\frac{244}{365}\n\\]\n\n**Final Answer:**  \nThe probability that Maxim was born in 2008 is \\(\\boxed{\\dfrac{244}{365}}\\).", "ground_truth_solution": "\n1. Determine the interval in which Maxim could have been born:\n   - Maxim starts school on September 1, 2014, at the age of 6. \n   - Therefore, his date of birth must be between September 2, 2007, and August 31, 2008.\n\n2. Calculate the number of days in this interval:\n    - From September 2, 2007, to September 30, 2007: \\(30 - 2 + 1 = 29\\) days (September)\n    - October 2007: 31 days\n    - November 2007: 30 days\n    - December 2007: 31 days\n    - January 2008: 31 days\n    - February 2008: 29 days (leap year)\n    - March 2008: 31 days\n    - April 2008: 30 days\n    - May 2008: 31 days\n    - June 2008: 30 days\n    - July 2008: 31 days\n    - August 2008: 31 days\n\n    Summing these up:\n    \\[\n    29 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 31 + 29 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 31 = 365 \\text{ days}\n    \\]\n   \n3. Compute the days in 2008:\n   - From January 1, 2008, to August 31, 2008, inclusive:\n     \\[\n     31 \\text{(Jan)} + 29 \\text{(Feb)} + 31 \\text{(Mar)} + 30 \\text{(Apr)} + 31 \\text{(May)} + 30 \\text{(Jun)} + 31 \\text{(Jul)} + 31 \\text{(Aug)}\n     \\]\n     \\[\n     = 31 + 29 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 30 + 31 + 31 = 244 \\text{ days}\n     \\]\n\n4. Calculate the probability:\n    - Each day is equally likely to be Maxim's birthdate.\n    - Therefore, the probability that Maxim was born in 2008 is the ratio of the number of days in 2008 to the total number of days in the interval.\n    \\[\n    \\text{Probability} = \\frac{244}{365}\n    \\]\n\n### Con